 "_report": "Ystra on the V3 kit. The whole endgame chain is kept untouched: Arrival Fragment (153, healing stone, research dome 181) -> Floating Continents A/B (154/155) -> Drowned Seas (156, water edge) -> Sun Forge (157) -> Crystal Ruins 1F/2F (158/159, saga_reveal and tamsin_map_room) -> Blighted Forest A/B (160/161, blight_begging) -> Edge of the Void (162, Oblivane P02) -> Seedmother's Grove (163, P03). Its edges are re-listed unchanged (157->158, 158->159, 159->160 stay warps). New: a small town between the arrival and Part A: Fragment Lane Homes (863: Seed Vault 859, two doors into the Ystra Crystal Lodge 189) and Crystal Crossroads (849), whose north arm is the Fragment Quiet Court (864: kit Recovery Bay 862, Shop 866, Memory Hall 861, Ancient Dwelling 860). South of 849 is Glasswood Junction (850): west the Ancient Crystal Ring (842 -> lobby 843 -> arena 844), east the Ystra Spaceport (867, ship home to Dustara), south Glasswood Hollows (855) to the Seedfall Farmstead (865, two doors into 189). West of the farm is the Void Fork (851): west the Secret Grove (858, chest), north Void Crack Bend (856) to the Shardheart Cave (845 entrance, 846/847, Deep Chamber 848 with a chest), south Seedmother Flats (857) -> Still Crystal Pool (854) -> Red Sun Overlook (853) -> Shard Slope (852, dead end with a chest).",
